# Whitelist: ignore everything, then admit only the two website builds.
# Deliberate — the sibling folders hold competitor research, Figma text dumps
# and pricing work that shouldn't leave the machine, and a blacklist would let
# them slip in the first time someone runs `git add -A`.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!vercel.json

!website/
!website/**
!wordpress/
!wordpress/**

# --- never, under any circumstance --------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.claude/
